# do not delete me
#
# Git tracks files, not directories, so this directory would vanish from
# the next clone without a file in it. This is that file. It ignores
# nothing on purpose — see `keepMarker` in schemas/cat-harness.ts.
#
# library/
# L1 source content: one `<bib-slug>/` per ingested WHO publication,
# holding `sections/*.md` and `structure.json`. Every knowledge-graph
# reference to one of these sources resolves through here, never to a
# loose path or a bare URL.
